============================================================================================

Families indexed by n=3..14. For H(n) and Pf(n): minimal recurrence + spectrum.

family           | inv | ord | e1=sum | e_last=prod | unimodular? | dominant root (temp)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
up(all)          | H   |   3 |      1 |           1 |     YES     | char [1, -1, -1, -1]  growth~1.839
