Reading: e_last in {+1,-1} confirms UNIMODULAR transfer = parity (Pfaffian face, S713).
e1 (sum of roots) = the geometry; the dominant root = the temperature (1=additive, >1=hot).
Families with the SAME (order,e1,e_last) but different middle = different TEMPERATURE only.
